# Paused, every sound stops (src/sound.h, sound_pause): records the game's sound (/out/sound.wav).
# Into play as engine_sound.steps, the hum at cruise, then START (the debug camera: the game
# frozen) for 3 s, a turn press while paused (no whoosh), START again: the hum's back at the pitch
# it had, then a turn's whoosh. Then the pause menu turns the sound effects off: silent
record_sound
wait_boot
start_intro
press b
wait 3.5
wait 2
press left
wait 1
press up
wait 1
press right
wait 4
shot pause_0_riding
press start
wait 1.5
shot pause_1_paused
wait 1.5
press start
wait 2
shot pause_2_back
press left
wait 1.5
shot pause_3_end
# The menu's sound effects off (START, L twice to "Sound effects", R, START): riding on and a
# turn, and nothing's heard
wait 1.5
press start
press l 2
press r
wait 0.5
shot pause_4_sound_off
press start
wait 2
press right
wait 1.5
shot pause_5_silent
